-- Additive, repeatable development fixtures. All people, properties and conversations are fictional.
-- Dates are relative only at first insertion; reruns preserve existing records. Stock photos: docs/seed-data.md.

ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

